                    <seg rendition="#center">[Attachment]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Extract From Radio Speech of the President of the
                        Republic of Finland, April 9, 1948</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The President of the Republic of Finland, Juho Paasikivi, in a radio speech on
                    April 9, 1948, with reference to the Agreement of Friendship, Co-operation and
                    Mutual Assistance between the Republic of Finland and the Union of Soviet
                    Socialist Republics, remarked i.a.</p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>“In view of the doubts expressed abroad, it may be added that no secret
                        articles are annexed to the Agreement”.</p>
                </quote>
            </div>
